      "description": "Sets the prefetcher back to prefetching for both boot and application launches (3, the client value) if a tweak tool turned it off or left it at 1, which keeps only application-launch prefetch. Restoring the default isn't a performance setting; it brings back Windows' own launch and boot prefetching.",
