      "id": "gaming", "name": "Gaming input and sound", "tier": "collection",
      "summary": "Game Mode, no mouse acceleration, End task, no audio ducking.",
      "description": "Opt-in gaming preferences: Game Mode kept on (Windows' default), no accessibility-shortcut prompts, game audio not lowered during calls, no mouse acceleration, End task on taskbar menus. Some stored values are community-documented (see each entry). No power-plan changes: High performance and USB power changes were removed on 2026-10-22 (no measured gain, and they cost laptops battery).",
